{"id": "hs-ja-001", "lang": "ja", "text": "仕事のストレスは高血圧のリスクを高める。", "entities": [{"start": 0, "end": 7, "text": "仕事のストレス", "type": "Stressor", "id": "HS:work_stress"}, {"start": 8, "end": 11, "text": "高血圧", "type": "Condition", "id": "HS:hypertension"}], "relations": [{"head": 0, "tail": 1, "type": "INCREASES_RISK_OF", "negated": false}], "source": "seed"}
{"id": "hs-ja-002", "lang": "ja", "text": "夜勤は不眠症を引き起こす。", "entities": [{"start": 0, "end": 2, "text": "夜勤", "type": "Stressor", "id": "HS:shift_work"}, {"start": 3, "end": 6, "text": "不眠症", "type": "Condition", "id": "HS:insomnia"}], "relations": [{"head": 0, "tail": 1, "type": "INCREASES_RISK_OF", "negated": false}], "source": "seed"}
